                          </tr>
                        </table></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table></td>
              </tr>
            </table></td>
        </tr>

  <tr>
    <td align="left" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:0;Margin:0;padding-top:20px;padding-right:50px;padding-left:50px;background-color:#ffffff" data-custom-paddings="true">
      <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="none" style="mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px">
        <tr>
          <td align="left" style="padding:0;Margin:0;width:500px">
            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px">
              <tr>
                <td align="left" class="es-text-3947" style="padding:0;Margin:0"><h2 style="Margin:0;font-family:roboto, 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;letter-spacing:0;font-size:24px;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;line-height:28.8px;color:#212121"><b class="es-text-mobile-size-16" style="font-size:16px">Wanneer haal ik de bestelling op?</b></h2></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td align="left" style="padding:0;Margin:0"><p style="Margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:roboto, 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0;color:#131313;font-size:16px">U kan uw pakket ophalen tijdens onze openingstijden.</p><p style="Margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:roboto, 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0;color:#4472c4;font-size:16px"><b>Maandag t/m vrijdag van 8 uur tot 5 uur</b></p><p style="Margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:roboto, 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0;color:#4472C4;font-size:16px"><b><br></b></p><p style="Margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:roboto, 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0;color:#333333;font-size:16px">Tijdens onze pauzes is afhalen niet mogelijk.</p><p style="Margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:roboto, 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0;color:#4472C4;font-size:16px"><b>Koffiepauze tussen 9 uur en half 10 <br>Lunchpauze tussen half 1 en 1 uur</b></p></td>
              </tr>
            </table></td>
        </tr>
      </table></td>
  </tr>

        {#       End white Block         #}
{% endblock %}

